WEBVTT

00:11:59.241 --> 00:12:02.135
I've ever heard coming from any organism,

00:12:02.159 --> 00:12:04.878
human or other.

00:12:06.517 --> 00:12:22.156
(Beaver crying)

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:23.971
Yeah. Well.

00:12:23.995 --> 00:12:26.553
There are many facets to soundscapes,

00:12:26.577 --> 00:12:29.769
among them the ways in which animals
taught us to dance and sing,

00:12:29.793 --> 00:12:32.394
which I'll save for another time.